{%- comment -%}
  Product info accordion: Details, Science, Ingredients, Customer Results, Shipping & Delivery.
  Closed rows are rounded cards with a + sign. Open rows show a soft grey panel with the content inside.
  WHERE: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Product page > Product information > Add block > Custom Liquid, drag it under your buy buttons, paste this in.
  If your theme already has its own collapsible rows, hide or remove them so you do not have two sets.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead. Use &amp; for an ampersand.
  mb_t1 ... mb_t5 = the five row titles (leave one empty to hide that row).
  The five blocks of text are separated by @@ and each line splits its parts with |||
    Row 1 (mb_d1) = label rows with a sparkle icon:    LABEL ||| text
    Row 2 (mb_d2) = timeline steps:                    STEP 1 ||| text      (mb_head2 = small heading, mb_img2 = optional picture link)
    Row 3 (mb_d3) = ingredient cards:                  Name ||| picture link (can be empty) ||| benefit one; benefit two; benefit three
    Row 4 (mb_d4) and Row 5 (mb_d5) = paragraphs and bullet lines:
        a plain paragraph:        text
        a paragraph with a bold start:   Bold start ||| rest of the text
        a bold line on its own:   Bold line |||
        a bullet line:            - 93% ||| rest of the text        (start the line with a dash and a space)
  mb_color_head = row title colour. mb_color_label = gold label colour. mb_color_text = body text colour. mb_icon_color = sparkle icon colour.
  mb_border = row border. mb_panel_bg = grey panel colour. mb_radius = corner roundness. mb_gap = space between rows.
  mb_single = true opens one row at a time. mb_open_first = true opens the first row on page load.
  mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below the whole block.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign mb_t1 = 'Details' -%}
{%- assign mb_t2 = 'Science' -%}
{%- assign mb_t3 = 'Ingredients' -%}
{%- assign mb_t4 = 'Customer Results' -%}
{%- assign mb_t5 = 'Shipping &amp; Delivery' -%}
{%- capture mb_d1 -%}
SUITABLE FOR ||| Crepey, dry, itchy skin that no longer responds to regular lotions or creams. Made for post-menopausal and hormonal skin — especially on the neck, chest, arms, and legs.
@@
FEELS LIKE ||| A lightweight dry oil that melts instantly into skin — no greasy film, no sticky residue. Leaves skin soft, smooth, and touchable with softness that lasts all day.
@@
ABSORPTION ||| Absorbs into the skin&#39;s lipid barrier rather than sitting on top. After menopause, water-based lotions cannot penetrate — a botanical oil matches the barrier&#39;s chemistry and absorbs instead of evaporating.
@@
SCENT ||| A soft, clean botanical scent from the cold-pressing process. No synthetic fragrance. Subtle enough to wear under anything, present enough for people to ask about.
@@
FREE FROM ||| No water. No silicones. No parabens. No mineral oil. No heavy waxes or pore-clogging fillers. Just six cold-pressed botanical oils for post-menopausal skin.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mb_head2 = 'How It Works Over Time' -%}
{%- assign mb_img2 = '' -%}
{%- capture mb_d2 -%}
STEP 1 ||| Cold-pressed botanical oils absorb directly into the skin&#39;s lipid barrier rather than sitting on the surface.
@@
STEP 2 ||| Marula oil delivers oleic acid to match the skin&#39;s natural lipid profile, restoring what oestrogen decline takes away.
@@
STEP 3 ||| Rosehip seed oil penetrates deeply to firm crepey texture and visibly smooth dry, rough areas.
@@
STEP 4 ||| Argan oil seals moisture into the barrier and keeps skin soft and comfortable throughout the day.
@@
STEP 5 ||| Sea buckthorn oil provides antioxidant protection and supports the skin&#39;s natural renewal process.
@@
STEP 6 ||| Together, six cold-pressed oils leave post-menopausal skin nourished, soft, and visibly smoother — without grease or residue.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture mb_d3 -%}
Berberine HCl ||| ||| Add a benefit; Add a benefit; Add a benefit
@@
Cinnamon ||| ||| Add a benefit; Add a benefit; Add a benefit
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture mb_d4 -%}
Add one sentence that introduces your results. Only use figures from your own customer survey.
@@
- 00% ||| Replace with a real result from your own survey.
@@
- 00% ||| Replace with another real result.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture mb_d5 -%}
Add your order processing time here.
@@
Estimated delivery times: ||| 
@@
- Your country: ||| Add the delivery estimate.
@@
- International: ||| Add the delivery estimate.
@@
Returns ||| Add your return policy here.
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mb_color_head = '#5e4312' -%}
{%- assign mb_color_label = '#9f6700' -%}
{%- assign mb_color_text = '#1a1a1a' -%}
{%- assign mb_icon_color = '#2a2a2a' -%}
{%- assign mb_border = '#e1dcd2' -%}
{%- assign mb_panel_bg = '#f5f3ee' -%}
{%- assign mb_radius = '12px' -%}
{%- assign mb_gap = '8px' -%}
{%- assign mb_single = true -%}
{%- assign mb_open_first = false -%}
{%- assign mb_top = '16px' -%}
{%- assign mb_bottom = '0px' -%}
{%- assign mb_uid = 'mb-ac-' | append: section.id | append: block.id -%}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="style" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'">
<noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"></noscript>

<style>
.mb-ac{box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--mb-ac-gap);width:100%;margin:var(--mb-ac-top) 0 var(--mb-ac-bottom);padding:0;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;text-align:left}
.mb-ac *{box-sizing:border-box}
.mb-ac p,.mb-ac li,.mb-ac strong,.mb-ac span{color:var(--mb-ac-tx)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-ac-tx)!important;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none}
.mb-ac__it{border:1px solid var(--mb-ac-bd)!important;border-radius:var(--mb-ac-r);background:#fff}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__hd{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;width:100%;margin:0;padding:15px 18px;border:0!important;border-radius:var(--mb-ac-r);background:transparent!important;box-shadow:none;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;text-align:left;text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;cursor:pointer}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__hd .mb-ac__ti{font-size:15px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;color:var(--mb-ac-hd)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-ac-hd)!important}
.mb-ac__hd:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--mb-ac-hd);outline-offset:-2px}
.mb-ac__ic{position:relative;display:block;flex:none;width:11px;height:11px}
.mb-ac__ic::before,.mb-ac__ic::after{content:'';position:absolute;background:var(--mb-ac-hd);border-radius:1px;transition:transform .25s ease,opacity .25s ease}
.mb-ac__ic::before{left:0;right:0;top:5px;height:1.6px}
.mb-ac__ic::after{top:0;bottom:0;left:4.7px;width:1.6px}
.mb-ac__it.is-open .mb-ac__ic::after{transform:scaleY(0);opacity:0}
.mb-ac__pn{display:grid;grid-template-rows:0fr;transition:grid-template-rows .28s ease}
.mb-ac__it.is-open .mb-ac__pn{grid-template-rows:1fr}
.mb-ac__in{min-height:0;overflow:hidden;visibility:hidden;transition:visibility 0s linear .28s}
.mb-ac__it.is-open .mb-ac__in{visibility:visible;transition-delay:0s}
.mb-ac__bx{margin:0 11px 12px;padding:20px 17px 4px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--mb-ac-pn)}
.mb-ac__row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;margin:0 0 20px}
.mb-ac__sp{display:block;flex:none;width:18px;height:18px;margin-top:1px}
.mb-ac__sp svg{display:block;width:18px;height:18px;fill:none;stroke:var(--mb-ac-ic);stroke-width:1;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-linecap:round}
.mb-ac__sp svg path{stroke:var(--mb-ac-ic)!important}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__lb{margin:0;padding:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.35;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mb-ac-lb)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-ac-lb)!important}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__tx{margin:2px 0 0;padding:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__h{margin:0 0 14px;padding:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:var(--mb-ac-lb)!important;-webkit-text-fill-color:var(--mb-ac-lb)!important}
.mb-ac__im{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 0 18px;border-radius:10px}
.mb-ac__steps{position:relative;margin:0 0 4px}
.mb-ac__st:not(:last-child)::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:4px;top:9.5px;width:1px;height:calc(100% + 20px);background:var(--mb-ac-lb);opacity:.35}
.mb-ac__st{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin:0 0 20px}
.mb-ac__dot{position:relative;display:block;flex:none;width:9px;height:9px;margin-top:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mb-ac-lb)}
.mb-ac__ing{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:14px;margin:0 0 20px}
.mb-ac__ig{display:block;flex:none;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__nm{margin:0 0 4px;padding:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;text-transform:capitalize}
.mb-ac__ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__ul li{position:relative;margin:0;padding:0 0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:21px}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__ul li::before,.mb-ac .mb-ac__bl::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:1px;top:9px;width:4px;height:4px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mb-ac-tx)}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__pp{margin:0 0 14px;padding:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__bl{position:relative;margin:0 0 8px;padding:0 0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;line-height:22px}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__bl::before{top:10px}
.mb-ac strong{font-family:inherit!important;font-size:inherit!important;font-style:normal!important;line-height:inherit!important;letter-spacing:0!important;text-transform:none!important}
.mb-ac .mb-ac__pp strong,.mb-ac .mb-ac__bl strong{font-weight:700!important}
</style>

<div class="mb-ac" id="{{ mb_uid }}" data-single="{{ mb_single }}" style="--mb-ac-hd:{{ mb_color_head }};--mb-ac-lb:{{ mb_color_label }};--mb-ac-tx:{{ mb_color_text }};--mb-ac-ic:{{ mb_icon_color }};--mb-ac-bd:{{ mb_border }};--mb-ac-pn:{{ mb_panel_bg }};--mb-ac-r:{{ mb_radius }};--mb-ac-gap:{{ mb_gap }};--mb-ac-top:{{ mb_top }};--mb-ac-bottom:{{ mb_bottom }}">
{%- for mb_n in (1..5) -%}
{%- case mb_n -%}
{%- when 1 -%}{%- assign mb_t = mb_t1 -%}{%- assign mb_d = mb_d1 -%}{%- assign mb_ty = 'rows' -%}
{%- when 2 -%}{%- assign mb_t = mb_t2 -%}{%- assign mb_d = mb_d2 -%}{%- assign mb_ty = 'steps' -%}
{%- when 3 -%}{%- assign mb_t = mb_t3 -%}{%- assign mb_d = mb_d3 -%}{%- assign mb_ty = 'ing' -%}
{%- when 4 -%}{%- assign mb_t = mb_t4 -%}{%- assign mb_d = mb_d4 -%}{%- assign mb_ty = 'list' -%}
{%- when 5 -%}{%- assign mb_t = mb_t5 -%}{%- assign mb_d = mb_d5 -%}{%- assign mb_ty = 'list' -%}
{%- endcase -%}
{%- if mb_t != blank -%}
{%- assign mb_isopen = false -%}
{%- if mb_open_first and mb_n == 1 -%}{%- assign mb_isopen = true -%}{%- endif -%}
<div class="mb-ac__it{% if mb_isopen %} is-open{% endif %}">
<button type="button" class="mb-ac__hd" id="{{ mb_uid }}-h{{ mb_n }}" aria-expanded="{{ mb_isopen }}" aria-controls="{{ mb_uid }}-p{{ mb_n }}"><span class="mb-ac__ti">{{ mb_t }}</span><span class="mb-ac__ic" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
<div class="mb-ac__pn" id="{{ mb_uid }}-p{{ mb_n }}" role="region" aria-labelledby="{{ mb_uid }}-h{{ mb_n }}"><div class="mb-ac__in"><div class="mb-ac__bx">
{%- assign mb_items = mb_d | split: '@@' -%}
{%- case mb_ty -%}
{%- when 'rows' -%}
{%- for mb_it in mb_items -%}{%- assign mb_f = mb_it | split: '|||' -%}{%- assign mb_a = mb_f[0] | strip -%}{%- assign mb_b = mb_f[1] | strip -%}
{%- if mb_a != blank -%}<div class="mb-ac__row"><span class="mb-ac__sp"><svg viewBox="0 0 18 18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M11.5 6.2c.55 3 1.9 4.4 4.9 4.95-3 .55-4.35 1.95-4.9 4.95-.55-3-1.95-4.4-4.9-4.95 2.95-.55 4.35-1.95 4.9-4.95z"/><path d="M5 1.2c.35 1.8 1.1 2.55 2.9 2.9-1.8.35-2.55 1.1-2.9 2.9-.35-1.8-1.1-2.55-2.9-2.9 1.8-.35 2.55-1.1 2.9-2.9z"/></svg></span><div><p class="mb-ac__lb">{{ mb_a }}</p>{%- if mb_b != blank -%}<p class="mb-ac__tx">{{ mb_b }}</p>{%- endif -%}</div></div>{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- when 'steps' -%}
{%- if mb_head2 != blank -%}<p class="mb-ac__h">{{ mb_head2 }}</p>{%- endif -%}
{%- if mb_img2 != blank -%}<img class="mb-ac__im" src="{{ mb_img2 }}" alt="" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{%- endif -%}
<div class="mb-ac__steps">
{%- for mb_it in mb_items -%}{%- assign mb_f = mb_it | split: '|||' -%}{%- assign mb_a = mb_f[0] | strip -%}{%- assign mb_b = mb_f[1] | strip -%}
{%- if mb_a != blank -%}<div class="mb-ac__st"><span class="mb-ac__dot"></span><div><p class="mb-ac__lb">{{ mb_a }}</p>{%- if mb_b != blank -%}<p class="mb-ac__tx">{{ mb_b }}</p>{%- endif -%}</div></div>{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
</div>
{%- when 'ing' -%}
{%- for mb_it in mb_items -%}{%- assign mb_f = mb_it | split: '|||' -%}{%- assign mb_a = mb_f[0] | strip -%}{%- assign mb_img = mb_f[1] | strip -%}{%- assign mb_bl = mb_f[2] | split: ';' -%}
{%- if mb_a != blank -%}<div class="mb-ac__ing">{%- if mb_img != blank -%}<img class="mb-ac__ig" src="{{ mb_img }}" alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async">{%- endif -%}<div><p class="mb-ac__nm">{{ mb_a }}</p><ul class="mb-ac__ul">{%- for mb_x in mb_bl -%}{%- assign mb_xs = mb_x | strip -%}{%- if mb_xs != blank -%}<li>{{ mb_xs }}</li>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</ul></div></div>{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- when 'list' -%}
{%- for mb_it in mb_items -%}{%- assign mb_f = mb_it | split: '|||' -%}{%- assign mb_a = mb_f[0] | strip -%}{%- assign mb_b = mb_f[1] | strip -%}
{%- assign mb_bul = false -%}
{%- assign mb_pre = mb_a | slice: 0, 2 -%}
{%- if mb_pre == '- ' -%}{%- assign mb_bul = true -%}{%- assign mb_a = mb_a | slice: 2, 400 | strip -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if mb_a != blank -%}
{%- assign mb_bold = false -%}
{%- if mb_it contains '|||' -%}{%- assign mb_bold = true -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- if mb_bul -%}<p class="mb-ac__bl">{%- if mb_b != blank -%}<strong>{{ mb_a }}</strong> {{ mb_b }}{%- elsif mb_bold -%}<strong>{{ mb_a }}</strong>{%- else -%}{{ mb_a }}{%- endif -%}</p>
{%- else -%}<p class="mb-ac__pp">{%- if mb_b != blank -%}<strong>{{ mb_a }}</strong> {{ mb_b }}{%- elsif mb_bold -%}<strong>{{ mb_a }}</strong>{%- else -%}{{ mb_a }}{%- endif -%}</p>{%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endcase -%}
</div></div></div>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
</div>

<script>
(function(){
function init(root){
if(root.getAttribute('data-on'))return;
root.setAttribute('data-on','1');
var single=root.getAttribute('data-single')==='true';
root.addEventListener('click',function(e){
var b=e.target&&e.target.closest?e.target.closest('.mb-ac__hd'):null;
if(!b||!root.contains(b))return;
var it=b.parentNode,open=!it.classList.contains('is-open');
if(open&&single){
var all=root.querySelectorAll('.mb-ac__it.is-open');
for(var i=0;i<all.length;i++){if(all[i]!==it){all[i].classList.remove('is-open');all[i].querySelector('.mb-ac__hd').setAttribute('aria-expanded','false')}}
}
it.classList.toggle('is-open',open);
b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',open?'true':'false');
});
}
function all(){document.querySelectorAll('.mb-ac').forEach(init)}
all();
document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load',all);
})();
</script>
